      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is one replacement person. Their facial identity, facial features, hair and hairline come from <Picture 2>. Their physique and body proportions come from <Picture 3>.\n<Picture 1> supplies the target scene, framing, camera angle, pose, clothing and lighting. Its original person's identity is not retained.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] Create one photorealistic still photograph by replacing the person in <Picture 1> with <Subject 1>.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved - retain the face from <Picture 2> and physique from <Picture 3>.\n<Picture 1>: partially_preserved - retain the setting, pose, clothing, framing and lighting; replace the original person.\n\ndetailed_description:\n<Subject 1> occupies the original person's position in the scene, wearing the clothing from <Picture 1> fitted naturally to their own proportions. The face is recognizably the person in <Picture 2>, not a blend with the original face or the face in <Picture 3>. Match the scene's perspective, illumination, shadows and natural photographic texture. Generate one replacement person, not additional people. The original person's identity is absent.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nN/A.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
